[I] A library for manipulating block devices

[T] Libblockdev is a C library supporting GObject introspection for
[T] manipulation of block devices. It has a plugin-based architecture
[T] where each technology (like LVM, Btrfs, MD RAID, Swap,...).

[U] https://storaged.org/

[A] Storaged Project
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/shell extra/desktop/gnome
[F] CROSS NO-LTO.clang

[E] opt gobject-introspection
[E] opt gtk-doc docbook-xml docbook-xsl

[L] LGPL
[V] 3.6.0
[P] X -----5---9 180.500

[D] 1fd4ce74db518340fa3890be1ed8f1ef912dd7a6b252c89161f4795d libblockdev-3.6.0.tar.gz https://github.com/storaged-project/libblockdev/releases/download/3.6.0/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' `pkg-config --cflags bytesize | sed 's|/bytesize||'`

[ $SDECFG_LIBC = musl ] &&
	hook_add premake 5 "sed -i 's/strerror_l *(\(.*\), [^)]*)/strerror (\1)/' src/*/*.c src/*/*/*.c"
